    "ja": "閉鎖・均質な人口割合SIR。RK4と別実装のSciPy DOP853を比較。人口保存・非負性・時間収束を確認。SEIR・空間伝播・実データ較正は対象外。",
    "en": "Closed homogeneous population-fraction SIR. Compare RK4 with independently implemented SciPy DOP853; check conservation, nonnegativity and time convergence. Excludes SEIR, spatial spread and calibration to observations."
  },
  "units": {
    "ja": "全変数・係数・時間は入力JSONに定めた無次元値。SIRは人口の割合。",
    "en": "Dimensionless variables, coefficients and time as specified in input JSON; SIR uses population fractions."
  },
  "boundaries": {
    "ja": "空間境界なし。初期値・時間区間／積分区間・標本数・seedは入力に固定。",
